[{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0404","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0404.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-53514","title":"Better Auth better-auth 组织插件未授权邀请接受漏洞","description":"Better Auth 的组织插件（organization plugin）中 `acceptInvitation`、`rejectInvitation`、`getInvitation` 和 `listUserInvitations` 四个邀请接收端点依赖 `session.user.email` 与 `invitation.email` 的字符串匹配来验证邀请者身份，但未强制要求邮箱已验证。当应用使用 `emailAndPassword: { enabled: true }` 且未启用 `requireEmailVerification` 时，攻击者可先用受害者的邮箱地址注册一个未经身份验证的账户并自动登录，随后获取组织管理员发出的邀请链接中的 `invitationId`，即可冒充受害者接受该邀请，以被邀请角色加入目标组织并读取组织范围内的敏感数据。该漏洞影响所有使用 better-auth 组织插件且未配置邮箱验证要求的应用程序，CVSS 评分为 7.7（高危）。修复方案为升级至 better-auth 1.6.11 或更高版本，该版本默认启用 `requireEmailVerificationOnInvitation` 并在所有四个端点中强制校验 `emailVerified` 状态。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.7,"aliases":["CVE-2026-53514","GHSA-fmh4-wcc4-5jm3"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-15T18:16:47.683","updated":"2026-07-21T13:41:03.313","remediation":"升级 better-auth 到 1.6.11 或更高版本，该版本默认启用 requireEmailVerificationOnInvitation 并对所有邀请端点增加已验证邮箱校验。如暂时无法升级，应在 organization 插件选项中设置 requireEmailVerificationOnInvitation: true，在 emailAndPassword 配置中启用 requireEmailVerification: true，并在组织邀请路由层添加中间件强制要求 session.user.emailVerified 为 true。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/better-auth/better-auth/commit/23094a628f007f801be6d26e5b15dc5fc6fc4eb8","https://github.com/better-auth/better-auth/pull/9577","https://github.com/better-auth/better-auth/releases/tag/v1.6.11","https://github.com/better-auth/better-auth/security/advisories/GHSA-fmh4-wcc4-5jm3","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/12b3733bfd1230e92fdd480cbc71e829b404ab11/cves/2026/53xxx/CVE-2026-53514.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/f352693f226c45464267beeea27f2ecfa0372f11/reports/2026-07-15/TIER_2_CVE-2026-53514.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/61c26bb0fa513d67ff37c47a0aee18a8017dee2d/npm/better-auth/CVE-2026-53514.yml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/7fa480de4a35333628fd1174156087809fb9b203/2026/53xxx/CVE-2026-53514.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/9af7ba4257c96e587dd93d2c4f7608ad02094e96/content/posts/cve-2026-53514.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2026-53514.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/7382c2b06ced5c0a9e3a3235f920776f951ff316/posts/cve-2026-53514-npm-better-auth.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/5ceb7b7e2bbbdef1e6ada0d3ecfe09bafdfb663e/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-fmh4-wcc4-5jm3/GHSA-fmh4-wcc4-5jm3.json","https://github.com/stevologic/security-recipes.ai/blob/f55e6317cf39bbe423517d172b0edcb8b78ff702/content/recipes/cve/cve-2026-53514-better-auth-vulnerable-to-unauthorized-invitation-acceptance-via-unverified-email-match-in-organization-plugin.md","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/20783e837c8d3900447582f2695481bf39f8f7ff/data/2026/CVE-2026-53514.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0404.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0402","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0402.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-53512","title":"Better Auth 框架 oidcProvider 与 mcp 插件 OAuth refresh_token 授予因缺少客户端身份验证导致的重放漏洞","description":"Better Auth 是一个 TypeScript 认证与授权库。其遗留插件 oidcProvider 和 mcp 暴露了 OAuth 2.0 令牌端点，在 refresh_token 授权模式下仅验证请求者持有绑定的 refreshToken 行及匹配的 client_id，未对机密客户端的 client_secret 进行校验。攻击者只要获取任意有效的 refresh_token（可通过数据库读取、日志捕获、浏览器端 XSS 或 mcp 场景下的 CORS 放大脚本等途径）以及公开的 client_id，即可通过 /api/auth/oauth2/token 或 /api/auth/mcp/token 端点持续伪造访问令牌和轮换刷新令牌，获得 indefinite 的持久化访问权限。攻击者利用此漏洞可在用户授权范围内读取或写入资源服务器所授权的全部资源。该漏洞影响使用 better-auth 且启用了 oidcProvider() 或 mcp() 插件的应用程序，且至少注册了一个机密 OAuth 客户端（类型为 web、native 或 user-agent-based）。已修复于 better-auth 1.6.11 版本，建议用户立即升级。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.1,"aliases":["CVE-2026-53512","GHSA-pw9m-5jxm-xr6h"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-15T18:16:47.420","updated":"2026-07-21T13:33:47.543","remediation":"建议将 better-auth 升级至 1.6.11 或更高版本，并将 deprecated 的 oidcProvider() 迁移至 @better-auth/oauth-provider。如暂无法升级，可强制将所有 OAuth 客户端类型设为 public 并启用 PKCE，同时在负载均衡器或反向代理层对 /api/auth/oauth2/token 和 /api/auth/mcp/token 实施 IP 白名单限制，并删除数据库中所有受影响的 oauthAccessToken 记录以撤销已泄露的 refresh_token。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/better-auth/better-auth/commit/1f2ff4215c4affff0b140b0c0a712c0dde35659c","https://github.com/better-auth/better-auth/pull/9576","https://github.com/better-auth/better-auth/releases/tag/v1.6.11","https://github.com/better-auth/better-auth/security/advisories/GHSA-pw9m-5jxm-xr6h","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7bafe961419ed00378435555d77a3a118a4791ff/cves/2026/53xxx/CVE-2026-53512.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/61c26bb0fa513d67ff37c47a0aee18a8017dee2d/npm/better-auth/CVE-2026-53512.yml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/534acb1a77595111808ebe0fe2a2596aaeee7283/2026/53xxx/CVE-2026-53512.json","https://github.com/zzzteph/low-hanging-vulns/blob/f15100526750b2cf9bd4dc0cc587f58f968afb29/nvd/2026/CRITICAL/CVE-2026-53512/README.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/432313e0f6d4852d6f7681192098c0e41f311fff/content/posts/cve-2026-53512.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2026-53512.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/1da22ed9f45ed8ce258da9f06c5d6d9741c5cc51/cve/CVE-2026-53512.html","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/f352693f226c45464267beeea27f2ecfa0372f11/reports/2026-07-15/JSON/TIER_3_CVE-2026-53512.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/812e13284092701ac2e48a9865618a02a3b2d95e/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-pw9m-5jxm-xr6h/GHSA-pw9m-5jxm-xr6h.json","https://github.com/stevologic/security-recipes.ai/blob/f55e6317cf39bbe423517d172b0edcb8b78ff702/content/recipes/cve/cve-2026-53512-better-auth-oauth-refresh-token-replay-via-missing-client-authentication-on-oidc-provider-and-mcp-plugins.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0402.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0236","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0236.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"adawolfa isdoc 未受控资源消耗漏洞（解压炸弹）","description":"adawolfa/isdoc 在读取 ISDOCX（ZIP）档案和嵌有 ISDOC 文档的 PDF 文件时，未对解压后数据大小进行校验，存在解压炸弹漏洞（CWE-400/CWE-409）。攻击者可构造特制的恶意文件，通过 getFromName() 解压 ISDOC 文档或 saveTo() 复制附件时，将极小文件膨胀至数 GB，导致内存或磁盘耗尽造成拒绝服务。该漏洞不影响机密性和完整性，仅影响可用性，需要用户打开恶意文件才能触发。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["GHSA-xg43-5579-qw6v"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-15","updated":"2026-07-15","remediation":"升级至 1.4.3、1.5.1、1.6.1 或 2.0.0 及以上版本。修复版本在解压前通过 statName() 读取 ZIP 中央目录中未压缩大小，对 ISDOC 文档限制 256KB、附件限制 32MB、PDF 内嵌文件限制 256MB，超出即抛出 ReaderException::zipEntryTooLarge() 等异常并中止。1.0–1.3 系列因生命周期终止不受支持，须升级到维护版本。临时措施：限制仅解析受信任来源的文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/adawolfa/isdoc/security/advisories/GHSA-xg43-5579-qw6v","https://github.com/adawolfa/isdoc/commit/935fb2aa41ceddfcf43174a61a36ec620611a105","https://github.com/adawolfa/isdoc/commit/02a10123a3d5fd92950b8e4952959317c0a18952","https://github.com/adawolfa/isdoc"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0236.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0052","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0052.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"奇安信网神 SecGate 3600 防火墙 obj_app_upfile 接口任意文件上传漏洞","description":"奇安信网神 SecGate 3600 防火墙的 obj_app_upfile 接口存在任意文件上传漏洞（CWE-434）。攻击者可通过构造特制的 multipart 请求包，向服务器上传包含恶意代码的 PHP 文件，从而获取服务器完全控制权限。该漏洞影响 SecGate 3600 系列防火墙设备，危害严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["NUCLEI-HTTP-VULNERABILITIES-SECWORLD-SECGATE-3600-FILE-UPLOAD-YAML"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2026-07-15","updated":"2026-07-15","remediation":"升级 SecGate 3600 防火墙固件至最新安全版本，限制 obj_app_upfile 接口的访问来源 IP，并在 Web 应用防火墙上添加文件上传检测规则以拦截恶意文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T01:53:16.157389923+00:00","references":["https://peiqi.wgpsec.org/wiki/iot/%E5%A5%87%E5%AE%89%E4%BF%A1/%E7%BD%91%E7%A5%9E%20SecGate%203600%20%E9%98%B2%E7%81%AB%E5%A2%99%20obj_app_upfile%20%E4%BB%BB%E6%84%8F%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E4%B8%8A%E4%BC%A0%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E.html","https://github.com/PeiQi0/PeiQi-WIKI-Book/blob/main/docs/wiki/iot/%E5%A5%87%E5%AE%89%E4%BF%A1/%E7%BD%91%E7%A5%9E%20SecGate%203600%20%E9%98%B2%E7%81%AB%E5%A2%99%20obj_app_upfile%20%E4%BB%BB%E6%84%8F%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E4%B8%8A%E4%BC%A0%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E.md"],"poc_urls":["https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/vulnerabilities/secworld/secgate-3600-file-upload.yaml"],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0052.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0095","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0095.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-53486","title":"npm decompress 路径穿越漏洞","description":"npm decompress 包在解压归档文件时存在路径穿越漏洞（CWE-22）。该漏洞源于三个方面：硬链接和符号链接条目未检查目标指向，导致可读取任意文件暴露到输出目录或劫持写入操作到目录之外；路径包含性检查仅使用简单字符串前缀比对，未对`../`等跨目录条目进行转义；文件权限模式未移除 setuid/setgid/sticky 位。攻击者可通过构造恶意归档文件，实现向目标目录之外任意位置读写文件。该漏洞影响 10.2.1 和 11.1.3 之前版本，CVSS 评分 9.1，危害等级严重，每周约 280 万次下载。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.1,"aliases":["CVE-2026-53486"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-07-14T21:17:05.447","updated":"2026-07-15T20:29:17.680","remediation":"将 `@xhmikosr/decompress` 升级至 10.2.1 或 11.1.3 及以上版本。升级后应对解压目录启用沙箱隔离机制，限制解压进程对输出目录外的文件系统访问权限。同时建议在解压前校验压缩包条目的路径合法性，拒绝包含绝对路径或上级目录引用的条目。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/XhmikosR/decompress/commit/281cefa00cd4275c10479bc5f1abba6b14dee8bd","https://github.com/XhmikosR/decompress/commit/60b5299402e72b0b53ca2e55222e9a1ccb44afae","https://github.com/XhmikosR/decompress/commit/9fcda4b0a66ca22dc8d337f9b0e7c30293c5fb89","https://github.com/XhmikosR/decompress/commit/aca5aac415dc04a6fae5200e51368cff436a09dd","https://github.com/XhmikosR/decompress/releases/tag/v10.2.1","https://github.com/XhmikosR/decompress/releases/tag/v11.1.3","https://github.com/XhmikosR/decompress/security/advisories/GHSA-mp2f-45pm-3cg9","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ed3e8dec058a54f5d840cd78ee86185dee6350a7/cves/2026/53xxx/CVE-2026-53486.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/39897d9afb3c6d42c7013893163963e5f59b4180/reports/2026-07-14/TIER_2_CVE-2026-53486.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/ccf2cc3d762789b06638ba5aa3e06982a53080c8/npm/decompress/CVE-2026-53486.yml","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2026/CVE-2026-53486/README.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/c008a0d6321845785f09dbf3840663b1f3185336/2026/53xxx/CVE-2026-53486.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/23e59fd10f7619445bb3ab1ba838f2e531989c40/content/posts/cve-2026-53486.md","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/0c7da69de8c9211abd9415ee499775016771b682/docs/2026/npm_decompress_%E8%B7%AF%E5%BE%84%E7%A9%BF%E8%B6%8A%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E_CVE-2026-53486.toml","https://github.com/zzzteph/low-hanging-vulns/blob/d96cdcee4ef80f9187069a225f8b6e61537923c7/nvd/2026/CRITICAL/CVE-2026-53486/README.md","https://github.com/docker-hardened-images/catalog/blob/f4dc551471d9e9ce3a9a5b95f1f4512ba83af5b2/image/hubble-ui/patch/remove-decompress.patch","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/23c72f0e29729596bf60b6750cbec12b936da4bf/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-mp2f-45pm-3cg9/GHSA-mp2f-45pm-3cg9.json","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-53486"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0095.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0314","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0314.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-49477","title":"Soup Sieve CSS选择器解析器正则表达式拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Soup Sieve（Beautiful Soup 4 使用的 CSS 选择器引擎）在 css_parser.py 中处理属性选择器时，其正则表达式存在灾难性回溯漏洞。当解析未闭合引号的属性值时，VALUE 正则模式进入指数级回溯，仅需约 300 字节的恶意载荷即可导致 CPU 占用超过 3 秒。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向使用 soupsieve.compile() 或 Beautiful Soup 的 .select()/.select_one() 方法的 Python 应用提交特制的 CSS 选择器字符串，触发正则表达式拒绝服务（ReDoS），导致服务线程阻塞和 CPU 资源耗尽。该漏洞影响 soupsieve 2.8.4 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。由于 soupsieve 是 beautifulsoup4 的自动依赖项，广泛部署的 Python Web 应用均受影响。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-49477","GHSA-836r-79rf-4m37"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-14T21:17:02.007","updated":"2026-07-21T16:17:13.337","remediation":"立即将 soupsieve 升级至 2.8.4 或更高版本（`pip install --upgrade soupsieve`）。如无法升级，避免将用户可控的 CSS 选择器字符串传入 `soupsieve.compile()` 或 Beautiful Soup 的 `.select()` / `.select_one()` 方法，并在应用层对输入长度和字符集做严格限制（如拒绝包含未闭合引号的输入）以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/facelessuser/soupsieve/commit/eb4397618709186c109400448c6043b728217dc3","https://github.com/facelessuser/soupsieve/releases/tag/2.8.4","https://github.com/facelessuser/soupsieve/security/advisories/GHSA-836r-79rf-4m37","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2026/49xxx/CVE-2026-49477.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/9a0b7a19487f40b2e217de2ad9f19cbcad032a8a/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-49477.md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/bd141078a7ff2a16f9bd8cc62066eb74bbd40e0e/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-49477.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/pypi/soupsieve/CVE-2026-49477.yml","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-49477","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/ef01d7e98bf039082d22217e9d85a4cfb59bb732/reports/2026-07-14/TIER_3_CVE-2026-49477.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/40201653244e9d985cea536a2ac651eca18f5fd4/2026/49xxx/CVE-2026-49477.json","https://github.com/SolaceLabs/solace-agent-mesh/blob/f76d8972fecac522055e8195b704ec631c698c99/CHANGELOG.md","https://github.com/browser-use/workflow-use/blob/fa53b3d4e49356f81f3c70496d54a465da30e93d/workflows/pyproject.toml","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/82ea664714059279a483073ac2764b0de54527ea/posts/cve-2026-49477-pip-soupsieve.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0314.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0313","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0313.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-49476","title":"Soup Sieve CSS选择器解析器资源耗尽漏洞","description":"Soup Sieve（Beautiful Soup 4 的 CSS 选择器引擎）在解析大型逗号分隔选择器列表时存在内存耗尽漏洞。攻击者无需身份认证，仅需向 soupsieve.compile() 或 Beautiful Soup 的 .select()/.select_one() 方法提交特制的 CSS 选择器字符串（如 500KB 输入可触发约 244MB 堆内存分配，放大比达 488 倍），即可导致目标应用内存耗尽，引发拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 soupsieve < 2.8.4 版本，所有依赖 beautifulsoup4 且接受用户 CSS 选择器输入的 Python Web 应用均受影响。已在 soupsieve 2.8.4 版本中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-49476","GHSA-2wc2-fm75-p42x"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-14T21:17:01.877","updated":"2026-07-15T20:22:12.343","remediation":"立即将 soupsieve 升级至 2.8.4 或更高版本：`pip install --upgrade soupsieve`。如无法立即升级，在调用 `soupsieve.compile()` 或 Beautiful Soup 的 `.select()`/`.select_one()` 前，对用户输入的 CSS 选择器字符串进行长度和逗号数量限制（如限制不超过 1024 字符且逗号分隔项不超过 100 个），或使用输入白名单过滤。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/facelessuser/soupsieve/commit/28108ab805818c832d9568142a99844fd95a0d39","https://github.com/facelessuser/soupsieve/releases/tag/2.8.4","https://github.com/facelessuser/soupsieve/security/advisories/GHSA-2wc2-fm75-p42x","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2026/49xxx/CVE-2026-49476.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/9a0b7a19487f40b2e217de2ad9f19cbcad032a8a/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-49476.md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/bd141078a7ff2a16f9bd8cc62066eb74bbd40e0e/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-49476.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/pypi/soupsieve/CVE-2026-49476.yml","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/ef01d7e98bf039082d22217e9d85a4cfb59bb732/reports/2026-07-14/TIER_3_CVE-2026-49476.md","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-49476","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/40201653244e9d985cea536a2ac651eca18f5fd4/2026/49xxx/CVE-2026-49476.json","https://github.com/SolaceLabs/solace-agent-mesh/blob/f76d8972fecac522055e8195b704ec631c698c99/CHANGELOG.md","https://github.com/robocorp/rpaframework/blob/2b3d3c4bd44d622efde7301c7bd5c3abfb612265/docs/source/releasenotes.rst","https://github.com/browser-use/workflow-use/blob/fa53b3d4e49356f81f3c70496d54a465da30e93d/workflows/pyproject.toml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0313.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0363","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0363.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-50659","title":"Microsoft .NET SMTP 客户端消息欺骗漏洞","description":"Microsoft .NET 的 SMTP 客户端实现（System.Net.Mail）存在输出编码或转义不当漏洞（CWE-116），攻击者可在邮件消息路由过程中进行消息欺骗，使接收方看到伪造的发件人地址或内容。该漏洞影响 .NET 8.0（低于 8.0.29）、.NET 9.0（低于 9.0.18）及 .NET 10.0（低于 10.0.10）的所有平台与架构版本，CVSS 评分 6.5，危害等级为中危。攻击者需具备较低权限并在网络上具备授权访问能力，无需用户交互即可发起利用。Microsoft 已在后续版本中修复此漏洞，建议升级至最新的 .NET 版本并重新编译部署自包含应用程序。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-50659","GHSA-74jp-vm22-8q8x"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-14T20:17:38.917","updated":"2026-07-22T21:17:42.713","remediation":".NET 8.0 应用升级至 8.0.29，.NET 9.0 升级至 9.0.18，.NET 10.0 升级至 10.0.10；通过 NuGet 更新 Microsoft.NetCore.App.Runtime 相关程序包引用并重新编译，或使用 dotnet --info 确认当前版本后通过 Visual Studio 更新至最新 .NET SDK，自包含部署的应用须重新编译并重新部署，更新后重启应用使补丁生效。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-50659","https://github.com/dotnet/core/blob/8284a6b46d384416350a482bbbfb023f0fdf4177/release-notes/10.0/cve.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4358541c3df4f2ba1793e172c3d7c89ba338eded/cves/2026/50xxx/CVE-2026-50659.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-50659","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/5e42b0394af9ea9a92d3a9525f7e445dad9e5f7c/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-50659.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/76fdd7fe4cd9d55f9aa8c105cb90aa42e34c98b9/content/posts/cve-2026-50659.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/nuget/Microsoft.NETCore.App.Runtime.win-x86/CVE-2026-50659.yml","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2026-50659.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2bf475c962629ec6f02e5caa819697d3f035d100/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-50659.json","https://github.com/dotnet/docs/blob/b2bd326ace411a28756f9f2e93e21ff289840a56/docs/framework/release-notes/2026/07-14-july-cumulative-update.md","https://github.com/alpinelinux/aports/blob/8dc9755558332e693602179ac57756a8496a6041/community/dotnet9-runtime/APKBUILD"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0363.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0362","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0362.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-50651","title":"微软 .NET HTTP/2 拒绝服务漏洞","description":".NET HTTP客户端存在 HTTP/2 协议处理缺陷，攻击者可通过发送特制 HTTP/2 数据流触发无限制资源分配（CWE-770），导致进程内存耗尽引发拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 .NET 8.0（≤8.0.28）、.NET 9.0（≤9.0.17）、.NET 10.0（≤10.0.9）全平台全架构版本，CVSS 3.1 评分 7.5（HIGH，AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:H）。攻击者无需身份认证、无需用户交互，仅需通过网络发送恶意 HTTP/2 请求即可远程触发内存耗尽，导致 .NET 应用崩溃拒绝服务。自包含部署应用需重新编译部署修复版本（.NET 8.0.29/9.0.18/10.0.10）方能修复。Microsoft 已于 2026 年 7 月发布安全公告并提供修复版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-50651","GHSA-wp74-jgxh-gv4q"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-14T20:17:38.387","updated":"2026-07-22T21:17:42.163","remediation":"建议立即升级 .NET 运行时到修复版本：.NET 8.0 升级至 8.0.29，.NET 9.0 升级至 9.0.18，.NET 10.0 升级至 10.0.10。通过 `dotnet --info` 检查当前版本，使用 `dotnet workload update` 或下载安装程序更新 SDK/运行时，引用 NuGet 包的项目更新 Microsoft.NetCore.App.Runtime.* 包至对应修复版本并重新编译部署自包含应用。临时缓解可在 Kestrel/ASP.NET Core 中设置 `Limits.MaxConcurrentConnections` 限制并发连接数，或在反向代理层限制 HTTP/2 并发流数。更新后需重启所有 .NET 应用使补丁生效。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-50651","https://github.com/dotnet/core/blob/8284a6b46d384416350a482bbbfb023f0fdf4177/release-notes/10.0/cve.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4358541c3df4f2ba1793e172c3d7c89ba338eded/cves/2026/50xxx/CVE-2026-50651.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/ef01d7e98bf039082d22217e9d85a4cfb59bb732/reports/2026-07-14/TIER_3_CVE-2026-50651.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dde61f61b53e6605a407232356bfa1ca7643b1ec/2026/50xxx/CVE-2026-50651.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-50651","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/5e42b0394af9ea9a92d3a9525f7e445dad9e5f7c/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-50651.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/nuget/Microsoft.NETCore.App.Runtime.win-x64/CVE-2026-50651.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/76fdd7fe4cd9d55f9aa8c105cb90aa42e34c98b9/content/posts/cve-2026-50651.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2026-50651.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/844aa1c07ff44ac335acd204e892575064d9be94/cve/CVE-2026-50651.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0362.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0361","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0361.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-50648","title":"微软 .NET XML 加密拒绝服务漏洞","description":".NET Framework 中的 System.Security.Cryptography.Xml 命名空间下的 XML 加密实现（EncryptedXml）存在资源未受限制分配漏洞（CWE-770）。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向使用受影响版本 System.Security.Cryptography.Xml NuGet 包的 .NET 应用发送特制的加密 XML 数据，触发无限制的资源消耗，导致目标服务拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 .NET 8.0（8.0.0 至 8.0.28）、.NET 9.0（9.0.0 至 9.0.17）以及 .NET 10.0（10.0.0 至 10.0.9）的所有平台和架构，攻击向量为网络、攻击复杂度低、无需权限或用户交互即可完成利用，主要危害为系统不可用。Microsoft 已发布安全更新修复该漏洞，受影响版本的用户应将 System.Security.Cryptography.Xml 包升级至对应已修复版本（.NET 8.0.29、.NET 9.0.18 或 .NET 10.0.10）并重新编译部署应用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-50648","GHSA-23rf-6693-g89p"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-14T20:17:37.937","updated":"2026-07-22T21:17:41.733","remediation":"立即将 System.Security.Cryptography.Xml 包升级到补丁版本：将 .NET 8.0 升级到 8.0.29、.NET 9.0 升级到 9.0.18、.NET 10.0 升级到 10.0.10。使用 NuGet 命令行执行 `dotnet add package System.Security.Cryptography.Xml --version 8.0.29`、`dotnet add package System.Security.Cryptography.Xml --version 9.0.18`、`dotnet add package System.Security.Cryptography.Xml --version 10.0.10` 进行升级，或通过 Visual Studio 的 NuGet 包管理器进行升级，然后重新编译部署应用以彻底修复这一拒绝服务漏洞。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-50648","https://github.com/dotnet/core/blob/8284a6b46d384416350a482bbbfb023f0fdf4177/release-notes/10.0/cve.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4358541c3df4f2ba1793e172c3d7c89ba338eded/cves/2026/50xxx/CVE-2026-50648.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/ef01d7e98bf039082d22217e9d85a4cfb59bb732/reports/2026-07-14/TIER_3_CVE-2026-50648.md","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-50648","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/5e42b0394af9ea9a92d3a9525f7e445dad9e5f7c/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-50648.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/nuget/System.Security.Cryptography.Xml/CVE-2026-50648.yml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2bf475c962629ec6f02e5caa819697d3f035d100/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-50648.json","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/e4d54534d9963512bc05d4e90b2e3212401aa945/cve/CVE-2026-50648.html","https://github.com/dotnet/docs/blob/b2bd326ace411a28756f9f2e93e21ff289840a56/docs/framework/release-notes/2026/07-14-july-cumulative-update.md","https://github.com/AzureAD/microsoft-identity-web/blob/dba8a0c46bb1153dc2b782c6484d92d5beb56bc5/Directory.Build.props"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0361.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0356","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0356.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-50528","title":"微软 .NET TLS/SSL 安全特性绕过漏洞","description":"这是一个针对微软 .NET 的安全功能绕过漏洞。攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的 TLS/SSL 网络数据包，利用 .NET 中 System.Net.Security 组件实现的授权检查缺陷绕过安全验证。当处理安全的网络通信时，攻击者能滥用未授权的权限访问 .NET 应用，这是由于安全流处理的认证逻辑存在缺陷。漏洞影响范围广泛，任何部署受影响版本 .NET 8、.NET 9 或 .NET 10 的应用程序都可能受到威胁，包括所有平台和架构。该漏洞属于高危级别，CVSS 评分为 8.2，通过网络远程攻击即可触发，攻击者无需身份验证即可发起攻击。该漏洞在 .NET 的安全通信协议上发现，通过 HTTPS 建立的网络连接中尤其容易受到攻击，攻击者能伪造合法的安全会话并绕过访问控制。该漏洞导致 .NET 安全机制失效，可能引发未经授权的数据访问或系统控制风险，已在 .NET 的安全补丁版本中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.2,"aliases":["CVE-2026-50528","GHSA-qvw7-jm5c-6hqw"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-14T20:17:37.533","updated":"2026-07-22T21:17:41.353","remediation":"立即升级 .NET 运行时：.NET 8.0 升级至 8.0.29 或更高版本，.NET 9.0 升级至 9.0.18 或更高版本，.NET 10.0 升级至 10.0.10 或更高版本。通过运行 `dotnet --info` 确认当前版本，通过 Visual Studio Installer 或下载 .NET SDK 进行升级。引用 Microsoft.NetCore.App.Runtime.* NuGet 包的项目需更新包引用至对应修复版本。自包含部署应用需重新编译并重新部署。升级后必须重启所有 .NET 应用使补丁生效。暂无有效临时缓解措施，必须升级运行时修复此 TLS/SSL 授权绕过漏洞。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-50528","https://github.com/dotnet/core/blob/8284a6b46d384416350a482bbbfb023f0fdf4177/release-notes/10.0/cve.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9615a84be27b28681e8a92dcc11ff360547df421/cves/2026/50xxx/CVE-2026-50528.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/ef01d7e98bf039082d22217e9d85a4cfb59bb732/reports/2026-07-14/TIER_3_CVE-2026-50528.md","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-50528","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/48383ebc821dc38e09ecfcea6060abac8038780f/2026/50xxx/CVE-2026-50528.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/88faa9369b8bcb4bdc7ab12bd672bb5c791c1c4b/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-50528.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/nuget/Microsoft.NETCore.App.Runtime.win-x86/CVE-2026-50528.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/76fdd7fe4cd9d55f9aa8c105cb90aa42e34c98b9/content/posts/cve-2026-50528.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2026-50528.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/634d12df2886254577e2fb10cf0313d024ae3a2f/cve/CVE-2026-50528.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0356.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0355","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0355.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-50526","title":"Microsoft .NET SDK 容器镜像构建过程本地资源注入篡改漏洞","description":".NET SDK (Microsoft.NET.Build.Containers) 容器镜像构建过程中存在不当链接解析漏洞 (CWE-59)，本地低权限攻击者可通过链接跟随方式注入恶意资源，导致同一台机器上其他用户构建的容器镜像被篡改。影响 .NET 8.0.0-8.0.28、.NET 9.0.0-9.0.17、.NET 10.0.0-10.0.9 版本，CVSS 7.0 高危，影响机密性、完整性、可用性均为高。攻击需本地低权限访问且攻击复杂度高，无需用户交互。Microsoft 已发布修复版本 (.NET 8.0.29/9.0.18/10.0.10)，建议升级 SDK 并重新编译部署自包含应用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.0,"aliases":["CVE-2026-50526","GHSA-55jh-fwmh-39m4"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-14T20:17:37.240","updated":"2026-07-22T21:17:40.993","remediation":"立即更新到修正版本：对于.NET 8用户请升级至8.0.29及以上版本；对于.NET 9用户请升级至9.0.18及以上版本；对于.NET 10用户请升级至10.0.10及以上版本。更新完成后重启应用程序生效。对于自包含应用程序，请重新编译并部署更新后的版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-50526","https://github.com/dotnet/core/blob/8284a6b46d384416350a482bbbfb023f0fdf4177/release-notes/10.0/cve.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f02fdda2bd389f5492ddcbf2ad808b3b60f20645/cves/2026/50xxx/CVE-2026-50526.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/ef01d7e98bf039082d22217e9d85a4cfb59bb732/reports/2026-07-14/TIER_3_CVE-2026-50526.md","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-50526","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/48383ebc821dc38e09ecfcea6060abac8038780f/2026/50xxx/CVE-2026-50526.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/88faa9369b8bcb4bdc7ab12bd672bb5c791c1c4b/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-50526.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2026-50526.md","https://github.com/alpinelinux/aports/blob/03c8f76a32366704fc95021efe40830fb6fc3193/community/dotnet9-runtime/APKBUILD","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/24f07005949aaf2eb169012a6779e6dffdc5a952/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-55jh-fwmh-39m4/GHSA-55jh-fwmh-39m4.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1910cec3a272a9634d53e73996abe765ad48da86/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-50526.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0355.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0354","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0354.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-50525","title":"Microsoft .NET XML加密拒绝服务漏洞","description":".NET XML 加密实现 (System.Security.Cryptography.Xml 中的 EncryptedXml) 存在资源分配无限制漏洞 (CWE-770)。攻击者可构造恶意加密 XML 数据，触发不受控的资源消耗，导致拒绝服务。影响 .NET 8.0.0-8.0.28、.NET 9.0.0-9.0.17、.NET 10.0.0-10.0.9 版本中使用 System.Security.Cryptography.Xml 包的应用，CVSS 7.5 (HIGH)，网络远程利用、低攻击复杂度、无需权限和用户交互。攻击者仅需发送精心构造的加密 XML 数据即可触发资源耗尽导致服务拒绝。微软已在 .NET 8.0.29、.NET 9.0.18、.NET 10.0.10 中修复，开发者需升级 System.Security.Cryptography.Xml NuGet 包至修复版本并重新编译部署应用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-50525","GHSA-8q5v-6pqq-x66h"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-14T20:17:37.120","updated":"2026-07-22T21:17:40.760","remediation":"立即通过 NuGet 更新 System.Security.Cryptography.Xml 包：.NET 8.0 升级到 8.0.29，.NET 9.0 升级到 9.0.18，.NET 10.0 升级到 10.0.10。使用 Visual Studio NuGet 包管理器、Package Manager Console 执行 `Update-Package -Id System.Security.Cryptography.Xml` 或 .NET CLI 执行 `dotnet add package System.Security.Cryptography.Xml` 更新后重新编译部署应用。建议同步更新 .NET Runtime/SDK 到对应版本（8.0.29/9.0.18/10.0.10）以获得完整防护。若暂时无法升级，可在网络层限制非受信 XML 输入作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-50525","https://github.com/dotnet/core/blob/8284a6b46d384416350a482bbbfb023f0fdf4177/release-notes/10.0/cve.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f02fdda2bd389f5492ddcbf2ad808b3b60f20645/cves/2026/50xxx/CVE-2026-50525.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/ef01d7e98bf039082d22217e9d85a4cfb59bb732/reports/2026-07-14/TIER_3_CVE-2026-50525.md","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-50525","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/88faa9369b8bcb4bdc7ab12bd672bb5c791c1c4b/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-50525.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/nuget/System.Security.Cryptography.Xml/CVE-2026-50525.yml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1910cec3a272a9634d53e73996abe765ad48da86/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-50525.json","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/6b00c577611f8969a848b6507a3313a26e1622cf/cve/CVE-2026-50525.html","https://github.com/dotnet/docs/blob/b2bd326ace411a28756f9f2e93e21ff289840a56/docs/framework/release-notes/2026/07-14-july-cumulative-update.md","https://github.com/AzureAD/microsoft-identity-web/blob/dba8a0c46bb1153dc2b782c6484d92d5beb56bc5/Directory.Build.props"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0354.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0353","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0353.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-50524","title":"微软 .NET 拒绝服务漏洞","description":".NET TLS/SSL (System.Net.Security) 存在拒绝服务漏洞，源于对 TLS 握手过程中输入类型验证不当 (CWE-1287)。攻击者无需身份认证，仅需通过网络发送精心构造的畸形 TLS 握手请求，即可触发 .NET 运行时在处理 TLS 握手时的异常，导致目标应用程序崩溃或变得无响应，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 .NET 8.0.0-8.0.28、.NET 9.0.0-9.0.17 及 .NET 10.0.0-10.0.9 所有受支持平台 (Linux/macOS/Windows、x64/ARM/ARM64/Musl) 的 Microsoft.NetCore.App.Runtime 运行时包，CVSS 3.1 评分 7.5 (HIGH，AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:H)，攻击向)。攻击者无需任何权限或用户交互，仅通过网络发送恶意 TLS 握手包即可远程触发拒绝服务。微软已在 .NET 8.0.29、9.0.18、10.0.10 版本中修复，受影响的自包含应用需重新编译部署修复版运行时。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-50524","GHSA-w7cw-xp7h-6j5j"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-14T20:17:37.000","updated":"2026-07-22T21:17:40.643","remediation":"建议立即升级 .NET 运行时到修复版本：.NET 10.0 升级至 10.0.10，.NET 9.0 升级至 9.0.18，.NET 8.0 升级至 8.0.29。通过运行 `dotnet --info` 检查当前版本，通过 Visual Studio 更新或下载安装最新 SDK/Runtime。引用 Microsoft.NETCore.App.Runtime 等易受攻击 NuGet 包的项目，需更新包引用至对应修复版本。更新后必须重启所有 .NET 应用程序使补丁生效。自包含部署应用需重新编译并重新部署。临时缓解措施：在网络层面限制非受信来源的 TLS 连接，或配置防火墙限制 TLS 握手来源 IP。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-50524","https://github.com/dotnet/core/blob/8284a6b46d384416350a482bbbfb023f0fdf4177/release-notes/10.0/cve.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f02fdda2bd389f5492ddcbf2ad808b3b60f20645/cves/2026/50xxx/CVE-2026-50524.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/ef01d7e98bf039082d22217e9d85a4cfb59bb732/reports/2026-07-14/TIER_3_CVE-2026-50524.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/48383ebc821dc38e09ecfcea6060abac8038780f/2026/50xxx/CVE-2026-50524.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-50524","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/88faa9369b8bcb4bdc7ab12bd672bb5c791c1c4b/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-50524.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/nuget/Microsoft.NETCore.App.Runtime.win-arm/CVE-2026-50524.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/76fdd7fe4cd9d55f9aa8c105cb90aa42e34c98b9/content/posts/cve-2026-50524.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2026-50524.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/9d5a7d1c566e3b3d2231325259c035dd0347ef0d/cve/CVE-2026-50524.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0353.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0292","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0292.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-47304","title":"Microsoft .NET XML 加密安全功能绕过漏洞","description":".NET XML 加密实现（System.Security.Cryptography.Xml）中存在安全功能绕过漏洞，源于对加密签名的验证不充分（CWE-347）。未经授权的远程攻击者可在无需身份认证和用户交互的情况下，通过网络向受影响系统发送特制的 XML 加密数据，绕过加密保护机制并访问被加密的敏感信息，进而导致机密性、完整性和可用性受损。该漏洞影响 .NET 8.0（≤8.0.28）、.NET 9.0（≤9.0.17）及 .NET 10.0（≤10.0.9）版本中 System.Security.Cryptography.Xml 包，CVSS 评分 8.1，危害等级高。Microsoft 已发布 NuGet 包更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.1,"aliases":["CVE-2026-47304","GHSA-g8r8-53c2-pm3f"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-14T19:17:08.830","updated":"2026-07-22T16:17:25.170","remediation":"将 System.Security.Cryptography.Xml NuGet 包升级至修复版本：.NET 8.0 升级至 8.0.29，.NET 9.0 升级至 9.0.18，.NET 10.0 升级至 10.0.10。可通过 `dotnet add package System.Security.Cryptography.Xml` 命令或 Visual Studio NuGet 包管理器更新，更新后重新编译部署应用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-47304","https://github.com/dotnet/core/blob/8284a6b46d384416350a482bbbfb023f0fdf4177/release-notes/10.0/cve.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f5661b9e41f1492ce39335948/cves/2026/47xxx/CVE-2026-47304.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/ef01d7e98bf039082d22217e9d85a4cfb59bb732/reports/2026-07-14/TIER_3_CVE-2026-47304.md","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-47304","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/4cbc1cd445b97bc2235c2b80e223e324747c59b3/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-47304.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/nuget/System.Security.Cryptography.Xml/CVE-2026-47304.yml","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2026-47304.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f2c577e1255b2c3fd617b7f1c499a222feb7